<title>POLAND: Polish construction sales up 6.8 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Polish construction sales up 6.8 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction sales rose 6.8 percent in May after a 17.7 percent increase in April and were 20.9 percent higher than in May 1996, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Construction sales in the January-May period rose 26.4 percent against the same period of 1996.</p>
<p> POLISH CONSTRUCTION		   MAY	 APRIL     MAY 1996</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)	    6.8	  17.7	  7.5</p>
<p> yr/yr change (pct)		   20.9	  35.9	 19.8</p>
<p> index (mthly avge 1994=100)     138.9	 129.7	  N/A @</p>
<p>NOTES - May 1997 and May 1996 had 21 working days and April 1997 had 23 working days. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
